---
/**
 * Per-page accent-rule bar — Mission 02.
 *
 * Renders a single short bar driven entirely by the `--page-accent`
 * custom property. That property is NOT set here — the page using this
 * component is responsible for setting `--page-accent` on its own
 * wrapping element (inline style), so the color never leaks to other
 * pages or to any other element (nav, buttons, cards) on the same page.
 *
 * See missions/MISSION_02_hero-accent-reel.md, Scope (in) #2.
 */
---

<div class="page-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .page-accent-bar {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 0.25rem;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 0;
    background: var(--page-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
</style>
